{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:35 2026-10-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:35 2026-10-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:35 2026-10-02 HKT</p><p>今(2日)下午2時36分，一名男子報案指他與另一名年約50歲男同事，到飛鵝山攀石，其間男同事失足墮崖，身體雖纜有攀石繩，惟看不到他墮崖後情況，未知其情況，消防接報到場，政府飛行服務隊亦派出直升機到場拯救。</p><img alt=\"直升機盤旋搜索墮崖男子。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a621e1f5d957559a32e94746c848ffa9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_16.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/fab219e8596a9e5b1ba08d01032c3825/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_16_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"直升機盤旋搜索墮崖男子。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0a8966f301130057c440908055cf9691/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/812f1e13141b43600d9bdfb10a040ada/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防及救護車到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ac29cb75b6f0a2c6d1154bc9bb43efa1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_16_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7c1430eceb52ecdc41cb7843fd535826/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_15_32_13.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T07:59:07.239121+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}